# The Aura app deploys as Expo (frontend) + FastAPI (backend) + MongoDB only.
# The PlatformIO/Arduino matrix firmware is a separate hardware artifact the user
# builds in VS Code — it is NOT part of the app deployment. Exclude it.
firmware/
firmware/**

